{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23650","headline":"新昌闲居招杨郎中兄弟 · 白居易","name":"新昌闲居招杨郎中兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纱巾角枕病眠翁，忙少闲多谁与同。\n但有双松当砌下，更无一事到心中。\n金章紫绶堪如梦，皂盖朱轮别似空。\n暑月贫家何所有，客来唯赠北窗风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}